    'Wyvern poison' => 'Wyvern poison',
    'Wyvern poison description' => 'This poison must be harvested from a dead or incapacitated wyvern. A creature subjected to this poison must make a DC 15 Constitution saving throw, taking 24 (7d6) poison damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.',
    'Yew wand' => 'Yew wand',
    'Yew wand description' => 'The average yew could grow to be 10 feet (3 meters) or more in diameter, with canopies reaching lengths of 50 feet (15 meters) or greater. Like oak trees they could live for hundreds or even thousands of years. Their wood was strong, yet flexible. All parts of a yew, with the exception of their red berries, were poisonous to ingest. The poison that could be derived from yew was known as taxine.',
